{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.poster.avif?t=1767320847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.webm?t=1767320847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/f5bf87b3385ccc80a6f17335203477e5.mp4?t=1767320847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pastel provides players with psychological fear of underwater or above-water objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore a blue space that is both beautiful and terrifying, looking for ways to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.poster.avif?t=1767320847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.webm?t=1767320847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/5ecc272214687d7b7504fcf1bb579b32.mp4?t=1767320847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you'll have to solve puzzles to clear your way, and sometimes you'll have to fight creepy creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.poster.avif?t=1767320847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.webm?t=1767320847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/extras/feca01b1fd16668dd07d2db23315f7f3.mp4?t=1767320847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the story by reading past logs scattered around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by submechanophobia and liminal space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: Switch between FPS and TPS perspectives at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS effects (noise, blur, fisheye lens effect, etc.) can be disabled from the pause menu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875820?t=1767320847","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/b5dafbfe5c07b01e4516a5e83b9c7a8e1b74dfdc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767320847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/5da0fbdb1ea8383ba73d156265ea0491c366628c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767320847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875820/5da0fbdb1ea8383ba73d156265ea0491c366628c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767320847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or may not be suitable for viewing at work: bleeding creatures, frequent violence, pistol shooting, bashing, killing creatures, fear of the dark, fear of water, psychological horror, jump scares, general mature content"},"demos":[{"appid":3285980,"description":""}],"deta